# Copy this file to `secrets.yaml` and fill in the keys for the providers you
# intend to call. Only the providers you actually use need to be present --
# `get_token` in src/models/adapters.py reads a single key on demand.
#
#   cp secrets.yaml.example secrets.yaml
#
# `secrets.yaml` is gitignored. Do not commit real keys.

